15b631b3-69ba-4073-a620-f4a347b94d35	How do I reset my account password or enable 2FA?	Account	You can reset your password anytime from the Login page by clicking Forgot Password. To manage Two-Factor Authentication (TOTP), navigate to Customer Profile > Security Settings.	\N	120	54	t	c64e3806-b382-4689-9f1a-94114205ce5f	2026-08-05 16:03:56.67175	2026-08-05 16:03:56.671829
2e7bd3d4-dffd-4d13-9b6a-ecb2c43f0b83	How do I request an updated invoice or receipt?	Billing	To download or request your monthly invoice, go to Dashboard > Billing > Invoice History. You can click any invoice to generate a PDF download or send a copy directly to your account email address.	\N	42	19	t	c64e3806-b382-4689-9f1a-94114205ce5f	2026-08-05 16:03:56.671053	2026-08-05 16:03:56.671168
40ac66cf-a549-41e0-9f4c-ff5f0397bc71	How is Customer Satisfaction (CSAT) calculated?	General	When a support ticket or live chat is resolved, customers can rate their experience on a 1-to-5 star scale and leave feedback comments. The CSAT rating is calculated as the average of all verified customer reviews.	\N	31	14	t	c64e3806-b382-4689-9f1a-94114205ce5f	2026-08-05 16:03:56.672248	2026-08-05 16:03:56.672333
493dfc50-b8fe-4c36-95a3-fb7fb2e4f874	What are our standard business hours?	General	Our global support team operates across multiple time zones to ensure you always get the help you need!\n\n- Level 1 Support (General Inquiries): Available 24/7, 365 days a year.\n- Level 2 Support (Technical & Billing): Available Monday through Friday, 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM (EST).\n- Dedicated Account Managers: Available during standard local business hours based on your region.\n\nOutside of standard business hours, our AI Agent will automatically answer common questions or route your ticket to the correct team for the next morning.\n	[0.005209331,0.005045395,-0.005133035,-0.0065788915,-0.0035624818,0.024526222,-0.004125994,-0.019665765,0.015294608,-0.052182946,-0.012683635,-0.00076164654,-0.0124240555,0.005929129,0.0059063183,0.00049999345,0.016936388,-0.001383551,0.0052734227,-0.004549721,0.008023172,-0.0022353346,-0.013851496,0.018304493,0.011667156,0.02091428,0.0023264138,0.009036035,-0.0038432481,0.13754348,-0.00558784,0.0054318802,-0.030768495,-0.020336168,-0.0009121626,-0.017659402,-0.023715846,0.017643876,-0.0022976268,-0.022724252,0.0073950873,0.026977513,-0.006672333,0.0006117588,-0.013680053,0.013757679,-0.003554472,-0.0075069824,0.01659648,-0.017661389,0.017431846,0.010837388,0.0088044545,-0.024206957,0.010427237,0.006484822,0.016305618,0.0019468574,-0.0024244231,0.019024221,-0.014475358,0.0008109285,0.006328866,0.016106851,-0.0006752336,-0.009561225,-0.0059276153,-0.012881882,0.024335293,-0.00426907,0.0026764558,0.034060754,-0.019226698,-0.0055984645,-0.011640002,-0.029392468,-0.021091437,0.016388146,-0.029331183,-0.010939886,0.016470274,0.016604587,-0.03245729,-0.025675867,-0.008214308,0.009039853,0.004652376,0.0021489274,-0.00025750184,0.026763616,0.009962002,-0.013852728,-0.0057808734,-0.0042339847,-0.011268373,0.0068067815,-0.019907618,-0.018904742,-0.0067174556,0.016044917,0.011379365,-0.012544689,0.039987348,-0.0018327262,0.008747825,0.0049459687,0.00439689,0.0052408