681cebde-fa36-423e-a229-18986847c409	Troubleshooting WebSocket connection issues	Technical	Real-time chat requires an active WebSocket connection to function properly. If you are seeing messages fail to send or the chat window is delayed, please check the following:\n\n1. Corporate Firewalls: Some enterprise networks block WebSocket (WSS) traffic by default. Ask your IT department to whitelist traffic on port 8001 and 443 for our domain.\n2. Browser Extensions: Strict ad-blockers or privacy extensions (like uBlock Origin or Privacy Badger) can occasionally intercept WebSocket handshakes. Try disabling them temporarily.\n3. Network Drops: If you switch from Wi-Fi to a Cellular network, the connection may drop. Refresh the page to force a manual reconnection.\n\nIf the issue persists, please open a High Priority ticket with the Technical support team.\n	[0.0027637882,0.021507084,-0.006111829,-0.0095510995,-0.017673422,0.008279721,-0.0071051144,0.010527233,-0.005021158,-0.065253794,-0.021509102,-0.0031639172,0.009805266,-0.024674308,-0.014376929,0.0020499935,0.013789117,-0.028892063,-0.017263716,-0.0048255464,0.011548847,0.003627302,0.0047950936,-0.01910961,-0.0042623444,0.03357873,0.002158639,-0.0033218658,-0.02808725,0.13957697,-0.010528486,0.0034474034,-0.004530061,-0.019278696,0.030482573,-0.0056359684,0.0019137133,0.008255917,-0.012392975,-0.010268856,0.014460546,0.0173755,0.006909562,-0.0020226114,-0.006924486,0.0012682005,-0.010464444,-0.005491252,0.0064125503,0.0010231701,0.0075882324,0.026686199,-0.0008473495,0.006196302,0.008516645,-0.009313541,0.006031511,-0.0018321688,-0.00493072,0.0019388447,-0.003909949,0.009982154,0.009337196,-0.013120455,0.009614359,-0.0058426913,0.008560093,0.00067523256,0.0011164567,0.0008929783,-0.0038464244,0.004085171,0.0063636038,0.0072489204,-0.018369872,-0.022334663,-0.032174006,0.036117934,-0.022410864,0.020561134,0.0005339378,-0.01972112,-0.01667895,-0.014351488,0.006843318,0.017793184,0.00039979952,0.017939292,0.0063439594,0.