83efcf29-d88c-4208-bef5-286fde78de72	Understanding your monthly subscription invoice	Billing	Your monthly subscription invoice contains a detailed breakdown of all charges incurred during the billing cycle. Here is how to read it:\n\n- Base Plan: This is the flat recurring fee for your chosen tier (Basic, Pro, or Enterprise).\n- Additional Seats: If you have added more agent seats beyond your plan's allowance, they will be billed here at a prorated daily rate.\n- Overages: Any usage that exceeds your plan limits (e.g., extra AI chatbot tokens or SMS messages) will be listed as overages.\n\nInvoices are generated on the 1st of every month. You can download PDF copies of all past invoices by navigating to Dashboard > Settings > Billing > Invoice History. \n	[-0.0016053247,0.007025965,0.015158858,-0.008929919,-0.0234253,0.0027827777,-0.0229014,0.012647109,0.015172963,-0.062630296,0.0007282669,0.015124642,0.009542367,-0.041378617,0.002220117,0.0054397574,0.010994077,-0.015145823,0.0009769294,-0.017844457,0.015379418,-0.00694039,-0.013593465,0.0037821196,-0.0022688168,-0.0041976594,0.010039743,0.00461599,-0.02619006,0.12295455,-0.009180227,-0.009610205,-0.016791567,-0.02152934,-0.011289237,-0.02743004,-0.005557339,0.015409699,-0.015607637,0.0034653926,0.008929785,0.03345833,-0.021762578,0.001677413,-0.042296465,0.0039751935,-0.0035972388,0.026239205,-0.00042494762,-0.013400624,-0.0035193001,0.007204878,-0.0052571963,-0.016687352,0.0010502972,0.0069401683,0.005427059,-0.016136654,-0.006566257,0.013718296,-0.020675134,0.014142693,0.015099785,-0.005825501,0.008215788,0.017639318,-0.003661074,-0.019753128,0.023066074,-0.0142287,-0.003921634,0.0043453234,-0.010380421,0.011805497,-0.018306283,-0.041490965,-0.027197879,0.0137452,0.0077777756,0.0049192635,-0.011367116,0.006622443,-0.030166052,-0.01741996,0.00046018913,-0.008586437,-0.0047671366,-0.0076558497,0.008761266,0.0030093652,0.025831945,-0.0139598055,-0.0005725163,-0.004550916,-0.004468983,0.0022589283,-0.002074528,0.001